Renovated 2+1 bedroom flat in Ermesinde, Valongo.

Property recently refurbished in a very elegant way has modern and functional finishes. 

It consists of:

- Entrance hall;

- Open Space: equipped kitchen with peninsula and common room;

- Laundry;

- Two bedrooms with built-in wardrobes (one is a suite with full bathroom);

- Two complete toilets;

- Interior bedroom ideal for office;

- Balcony;

- Parking space.

Amenities such as air conditioning, kitchen equipment included (oven, extractor hood with charcoal filter, ceramic hob, built-in refrigerator and microwave), built-in cabinets, built-in spotlights, natural light.

Well located next to the centre of Ermesinde with services, commerce and transport in the vicinity, highlighting:

- Several bus stops within a radius of 250 meters;

- Ermesinde train station a 10-minute walk away;

- Hypermarket at 350 meters;

- Citizen's Shop at 1300 meters;

- Cafes, restaurants; Hairdresser; Laundry; Veterinarian; Pharmacy; Schools and colleges.

- Good access via the N105, N107 and N208. Entrance to the A4 just a few minutes away.

Come and see this beautiful modern, comfortable and ready-to-live-in space!

